{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>MistakeBook 是一款協助學生建立個人錯題庫的學習工具，適合準備期中、期末或標準化考試的人士使用。它可透過相片、筆記與難度標籤記錄錯題，並按科目、章節及自訂標籤整理，毋須帳戶即可使用；現時原價 US $0.99，<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-180.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>智能複習與進度分析</h2>\n<p>內建複習模式提供測驗、練習與間隔重複，並按艾賓浩斯時間表安排回顧，讓薄弱環節在合適時機再次出現。進度圖表與每日簽到有助掌握熟練度趨勢及弱項；匯入、匯出備份可保存資料，所有內容留在裝置上，方便學生以簡單且私密的方式把錯誤轉化為更高分數。</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-206-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-207-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-208-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-209-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-210-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：MistakeBook – Wrong Answer Log</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/mistakebook-wrong-answer-log/id6770173206?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li>\n</ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T11:00:11.682884+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":312,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T10:50:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T21:37:07.869038+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T10:53:34.394356+00:00","content_hash":"b9a5aa185198d85824131713a77e166b96da2c5a0b95037d1e66c770a5276866","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}